4
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,020
The software is called Gap Gone.

5
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,940
It's specifically designed for quickly and roughly trimming down audio.

6
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,020
So, once you open an audio file,

7
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:13,480
The audio track is laid out just like lines of text, one after another.

8
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:16,280
This allows us to quickly make cuts just by using the mouse.

9
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,620
