21
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:45,120
the silent parts of the audio to shorten the video's overall length.

22
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:49,020
In this software, you can just click the top-right corner to delete them all with a single click.

23
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:50,700
all the silent parts in the audio.

24
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:53,340
And it does this automatically.

25
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:59,380
Finally, just hit 'Export,' and you'll get the final, trimmed audio.

26
